{* a mail to a watcher of the topic about a new reply (English); rendered once per language, queued for every watcher *}
<p>There is a new reply from <strong>{$reply->user->username}</strong> in the topic <strong>{$topic->name}</strong>.</p>
<p><a href={$url}>Show the reply</a></p>
<p style="color: #666; font-size: small">You will get the next notification about this topic after you open it again. Stop watching it with the button “Stop watching” in the topic.</p>
